
**`.env.example`**:

```env
# Bot Configuration
BOT_TOKEN=your_telegram_bot_token_here
BOT_MODE=polling
ADMIN_TELEGRAM_ID=123456789

# Webhook (только для BOT_MODE=webhook)
WEBHOOK_URL=https://your-domain.com/webhook
WEBHOOK_HOST=0.0.0.0
WEBHOOK_PORT=8080

# Database
DB_HOST=localhost
DB_PORT=5432
DB_USER=bot
DB_PASSWORD=secure_password
DB_NAME=bot

# Yandex Disk
YANDEX_DISK_PDF_URL=https://disk.yandex.ru/i/initial_pdf_link

# Logging
LOG_LEVEL=INFO
